{"title": "Difficult Terrain (status group)", "pageid": 34980, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Difficult_Terrain_(status_group)", "categories": ["Status groups"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/45px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><b>SG_DifficultTerrain</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Status_group\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status group\">status group</a>. Conditions in this status group affect the entities' movement speed.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Immunity\"> Immunity </span></h2>\n<p>The following items grant immunity to all conditions in this status group:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement\" title=\"Elixir of Guileful Movement\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/66/ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/66/ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/66/ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ELX_Elixir_of_Guileful_Movement_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/image