n_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Difficult Terrain: Web\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Difficult_Terrain:_Web_(Condition)\" title=\"Difficult Terrain: Web (Condition)\">Difficult Terrain: Web</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement speed</a> halved.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Haunted_Approach\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Haunted_Approach_(Condition)\" title=\"Haunted Approach (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Haunted Approach\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Haunted_Approach_(Condition)\" title=\"Haunted Approach (Condition)\">Haunted Approach</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>This creature's <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement speed\">Movement speed</a> and jump distance is halved while within 3 m (10 ft) of a <a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Skull\" title=\"Cursed Skull\">Cursed Skull</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Overgrown_Foliage\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Overgrown_Foliage_(Condition)\" title=\"Overgrown Foliage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Overgrown Foliage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Overgrown_Foliage_(Condition)\" title=\"Overgrown Foliage (Condition)\">Overgrown Foliage</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Creatures move at quarter speed in the overgrown foliage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Plant_Growth\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Plant_Growth_(Condition)\" title=\"Plant Growth (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Plant Growth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Difficult_Terrain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Plant_Growth_(Condition)\" title=\"Plant Growth (Condition)\">Plant Growth</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The ground is covered with plants and weeds. <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">Movement Speed</a> is quartered.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Selune's_Blessing:_Moonsnare\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Selune%27s_Blessing:_Moonsnare_(Condition)\" title=\"Selune's Blessing: Moonsnare (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Divine_Favour_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Divine_Favour_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Divine_Favour_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Divine_Favour_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Divine_Favour_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Divine_Favour_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Selune's Blessing: Moonsnare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Divine_Favour_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Divine_Favour_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Divine_Favour_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Selune%27s_Blessing:_Moonsnare_(Condition)\" title=\"Selune's Blessing: Moonsnare (